msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This device is managed by a user-space driver that you installed. Use that "
"driver to configure the tablet instead of using the settings here, unless "
"specifically instructed otherwise."
msgstr ""
"To napravo upravlja gonilnik uporabniškega prostora, ki ste ga namestili. Za "
"konfiguracijo tabličnega računalnika uporabite ta gonilnik namesto tukaj "
"navedenih nastavitev, razen če ni izrecno navedeno drugače."

